!String methodsFor: 'character scanner support' stamp: 'jmv 5/5/2022 11:14:55'!
                  scanCharactersFrom: startIndex to: stopIndex with: aCharacterScanner rightX: rightX stopConditions: stops
	"Double dispatch."

