	VAX-11/780 5MHz C HP Smalltalk								10k bytecodes/sec (Green Book, p.235)											450 clocks/bytecode
	VAX-11/780 5MHz C Berkeley St								17k bytecodes/sec (Green Book, p.203, awb)											300 clocks/bytecode
