!AbstractVectorCanvas methodsFor: 'drawing - icons' stamp: 'jmv 8/26/2021 12:25:07' overrides: 16896014!
   drawLeftIcon
	| c size |
	c _ currentMorph isPressed
		ifFalse: [`Color darkGray`]
		ifTrue: [`Color veryDarkGray`].
