                          guiSizePreferenceChanged
	"Some preference related to size of gui elements may have changed."
	IconPathData removeAll.! !
!AbstractVectorCanvas class methodsFor: 'class initialization' stamp: 'jmv 10/8/2021 09:45:19' overrides: 16904184!
                  initialize
